-- ###########################################################################
--  USER OVERRIDES — YOUR FILE. UPDATES NEVER TOUCH IT.
--
--  This is a TEMPLATE (user.lua.example is versioned; user.lua is not).
--  The installer copies this file to ~/.config/hypr/user.lua ONCE, only when
--  it does not exist yet. After that it is yours: git ignores it, so
--  `rice update` (a tag checkout + ./install.sh) can neither overwrite nor
--  conflict with it.
--
--  RULE: never edit hyprland.lua for personal tweaks — put them here.
--  This file loads LAST, so everything here wins over the rice defaults.
--  mainMod, terminal and fileManager are published here by hyprland.lua,
--  so they read exactly like they do there.
--
--  Keybinds you define here ALSO work, but they will NOT show in
--  Settings > Shortcuts (that list is parsed from hyprland.conf). If you
--  want a custom bind to appear there, put it in user.conf instead and
--  keep the rest here.
-- ###########################################################################

